        "Declarations — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/devicemanagement-declarations",
        "DeclarativeManagement command Data — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/declarativemanagementcommand/command-data.dictionary",
        "TokensResponse — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/tokensresponse"
